OL,3,GNEWSA'Emotional' world title for
OL,4,AFormula E team
OL,5,
OL,6,FA motorsport team boss has spoken of
OL,7,Fthe "emotional" and "proud" moment of
OL,8,Fwinning the World Championship.
OL,10,FJaguar TCS Racing drivers Mitch Evans
OL,11,Fand Antonio Felix da Costa secured a
OL,12,Fcombined four wins at the London E-Prix
OL,13,Fover the weekend which saw the
OL,14,FKidlington based team defended its
OL,15,FFormula E teams' title .
OL,17,FIt finished above nearest challengers
OL,18,FPorsche by 17 points for a second
OL,19,Fteams' world championship win in the
OL,20,FGEN3 era, where cars deliver up to
OL,21,F350kW of power, and a top speed of
OL,22,F320km/h (199mph).
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
